  - Click delivery to see details in modal
  - Pagination

- Create/Edit Modal (ModalSize.Large):
  - Name input, Format selection (3 buttons: Discord/Slack/Raw)
  - URL input, Secret input (optional)
  - Event types: Select all/Clear buttons
    - Domain filter buttons (auth/infra) with counts
    - Scrollable checklist grouped by domain
    - Shows count selected
  - Active toggle
  - Cancel/Save buttons

